{
  "about": "Refactor 17, Stage B, decision D1: the files of the surface portal join one workspace package @purin-labs/surface-portal in surfaces/portal. scripts/refactor-17/move-module.mjs reads this plan. files: each source file that scripts/layers.json gives the module, with its place in the target folder: a Worker file goes to server/ with its sub-path below services/platform/src/ (no folder of the module has the name portal/, so chat/ and control/routes/ keep their names), a Portal file goes to ui/ and keeps its sub-path below apps/portal/src/, the images of assets/ with styles.css, and no two files share a place. stays: apps/portal stays the Vite application, so the files that an HTML page of the Portal names (bootstrap.tsx, tv/main.tsx and the preview pages of dev/, which a later step splits by area) and vite-env.d.ts stay in apps/portal/src and keep the module surfaces/portal. sourcePrefixes: where --sync-plan puts a file that the module gets later. package: the manifest and the tsconfig of the new package; the versions of devDependencies come from the Worker and the Portal manifests. The exports map gives each .ts file of server/ and of ui/ and each style sheet of ui/ as an entry; a .tsx file that another module imports has an entry of its own. The tsconfig of the package reads server/ only. The Worker tsconfigs include surfaces/*/server and the Portal tsconfig includes surfaces/*/ui, so each file stays in the program that checked it before the move. edits: text edits of the files that name a source folder and cannot read scripts/lib/source-roots.mjs; an edit is done when the file holds its replace text. keepForm: each file where an import stays on its line, because the wrap of Prettier would move a ratchet, with its reason. regenerate: the commands that write a generated file again. package.typeCheck false: the package has no check:types script of its own. Its own files read the Env keys CASE, ORGANISATION and SESSION, which the Actor files of the Worker (workers/platform) merge, and MESSAGE_LINK_FETCH, which @purin-labs/agent merges, each with declare module of @purin-labs/kernel/env. Through the foundation packages that it imports the program also lacks CODE_MODE_SANDBOX, CONNECTOR and EVENT_Q. The package alone gives 190 errors, 23 of them in its own files. The Worker program checks each file of server/, and the Portal program each file of ui/.",
